    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88adb2854548c18c2f32d40c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草地3200米的长距离战。\n她在这个长途跑者们较劲之处竭尽了全力。\n会感到疲累也是当然的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "135fe86d2724b6ce1473780cdd20cb3c9b1f0c52ae181552484f91b57148d436",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
